  m_text: Many years ago, three mighty gods rules the world. The god of land, said
    to take the form of a dung beetle, would fertilize all crops to feed the world.
    The god of strength, said to take the form of a praying mantis, would protect
    the world from all dangers. And finally, the god of resurrection, said to take
    the form of a cicada, could resurrect all life. No appearances has been seen
    in over 1000 years, however legends has it that their powers has been sealed
    into masks and spread across the world.
